    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The classification of the Passenger Transport Hub."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/passenger-transport-hubs#TransportHub.accessibility> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/passenger-transport-hubs>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/passenger-transport-hubs#TransportHub>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/ns/mobiliteit/trips-en-aanbod#Accessibility>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The accessibility of the Passenger Transport Hub."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/passenger-transport-hubs#vehicleType> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/passenger-transport-hubs>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <http://schema.mobivoc.org/#Capacity>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Displays the vehicle types to which the capacity is linked."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/passenger-transport-hubs#TransportHub.brand> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/passenger-transport-hubs>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/passenger-transport-hubs#TransportHub>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The brand of the Passenger Transport Hub."@en;
    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "Example: Hoppinpoint, Mobipoint,..."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/passenger-transport-hubs#InfrastructureElement.accessibility> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
