    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The overall accessibility characteristics of the infrastructure element."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/passenger-transport-hubs#propulsion> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/passenger-transport-hubs>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/passenger-transport-hubs#ResourceReport>;
