    <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/usageNote> "For example whether the Mobility Service is accessible to persons with disabilities."@en;
    <http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status> <https://data.vlaanderen.be/id/concept/StandaardStatus/ErkendeStandaard>.
<https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/passenger-transport-hubs#AdditionalService.provider> a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/passenger-transport-hubs>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#domain> <https://purl.eu/ns/mobility/passenger-transport-hubs#AdditionalService>;
